  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/qL8ni4XCuBaCfgzDrt9Uq9ZqjuJ3OMLjJDJULJLWamg.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Area }=\\int_{-6}^4\\left\\{\\left(4-\\frac{x^2}{4}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{x-4}{2}\\right)\\right\\} d x \\\\ & =\\int_{-6}^4\\left\\{-\\frac{x^2}{4}-\\frac{x-6}{2}\\right\\} d x \\\\ & \\alpha=-\\frac{x^3}{12}-\\frac{x^2}{4}+\\left.6 x\\right|_{-6} ^4=\\frac{125}{3} \\\\ & \\therefore 6 \\alpha=250\\end{aligned}$",
